@startuml seq-exit
!include _style.iuml
title Exit (File > Exit, tray Exit) and Windows sign-out

actor User
participant App
participant MainPage
participant HotkeyListener
participant BrowserConnector
participant "exit flushes\n(TemplateEditor.FlushAsync)" as Flush
participant DataNode
participant StorageService
participant BackupScheduler

== Exit ==
User -> App : ExitAsync()
App -> App : EndTutorial()
App -> MainPage : ResolveUnsavedEditsAsync()\nSave / Don't save / Cancel
alt Cancel
  App --> User : stays open
end
App -> HotkeyListener : Register("None")
App -> BrowserConnector : Stop()
App -> App : PersistPendingAsync()
activate App
App -> Flush : registered flushes (editor content)
App -> DataNode : FlushPendingSaveAsync()\n(debounced edit + settings save now)
App -> StorageService : WaitForWritesAsync()
App -> BackupScheduler : FlushAsync(5 s)\n(a recent backup of changes not backed up)
deactivate App
alt still saving after 1 s
  App -> MainPage : ShowExitProgress()
  loop every 15 s while not done
    App -> MainPage : AskKeepWaitingForSaveAsync()
  end
end
App -> App : Shutdown(): tray icon off, instance key\nunregistered, Exit() (+5 s hard-exit watchdog)

== Sign-out / shutdown ==
participant Windows as OS
OS -> App : WM_QUERYENDSESSION
App -> MainPage : KeepUnsavedEditsAsync()\n(nothing can be asked: edits are saved)
App -> App : PersistPendingAsync() (started now)
OS -> App : WM_ENDSESSION
App -> App : stop hotkey and connector
App -> App : PumpMessagesUntil(saved, 4 s)
App -> App : Shutdown()
@enduml
